    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;satisfies&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then"
